    <item>
      <title>Creating an Internal Reverse Proxy</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/nginx-proxy-manager/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jan 2025 11:30:27 -0500</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/nginx-proxy-manager/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;requirements&#34;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A domain&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A device to host our docker containers (ex: Raspberry Pi)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A static IP set to the docker host&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;step-1-install-docker&#34;&gt;Step 1: Install Docker&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Using your distribution&amp;rsquo;s package manager, install the &lt;code&gt;docker&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;docker-compose&lt;/code&gt; packages.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To avoid having to use &lt;code&gt;sudo&lt;/code&gt; each time you run a docker command, follow Docker&amp;rsquo;s post-install instructions &lt;a href=&#34;https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/linux-postinstall/#manage-docker-as-a-non-root-user&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;step-2-set-up-the-structure&#34;&gt;Step 2: Set-up the Structure&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;For this example, we&amp;rsquo;ll be creating Nginx Proxy Manager and Pi-hole with Unbound containers. Create the docker folder, this will hold all our containers.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>South of 6 Project</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/bais-internship/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Aug 2023 13:40:10 -0500</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/bais-internship/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Over summer of 2023, I interned at the University of Iowa, working with non-profit organizations to collect, analyze and visualize their data. I chose to work with the South of 6 Business District in Iowa City, IA.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;view-the-recording&#34;&gt;View the recording!&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/X8ARGScV5_g?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;see-the-dashboards-i-created&#34;&gt;See the dashboards I created!&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;survey-dashboard&#34;&gt;Survey Dashboard&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://public.tableau.com/views/Southof6BusinessImpactSurvey/Dashboard1?:language=en-US&amp;amp;publish=yes&amp;amp;:display_count=n&amp;amp;:origin=viz_share_link&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;survey.png&#34; alt=&#34;Survey dashboard&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;Click the image to open the dashboard.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>NFL Data Project</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/nfl-data-project/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 10 May 2023 07:27:54 -0600</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/nfl-data-project/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;As a final project for my Database Management class, my group and I decided to analyze NFL statistics and front offices from 2009-2019 using SQL. The project site is linked &lt;a href=&#34;https://apex.oracle.com/pls/apex/r/nfl_data_project/nfl-data-analysis/home&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;, where you can find our analysis, visualizations, and tables.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;sql-queries&#34;&gt;SQL Queries&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Q1: Team Success&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sql&#34; data-lang=&#34;sql&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;SELECT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;TEAMNAME&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;WINS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;CASE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;WHEN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;WINS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;14&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;THEN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;Great&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;WHEN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;WINS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;THEN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;Good&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;WHEN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;WINS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;&amp;gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;mi&#34;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;THEN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;Okay&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;ELSE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;Poor&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;END&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;AS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;SeasonPerformance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;FROM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;TEAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;JOIN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;STATS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;ON&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;TEAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;TEAMID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;STATS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;TEAMID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;JOIN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;SEASON&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;ON&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;STATS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;SeasonID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;SEASON&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;SeasonID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;WHERE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;SEASON&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;SEASONID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;2019&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;ORDER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;BY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;WINS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;DESC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Q2: Head Coach Visualization&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Fedora Post-Installation Tweaks</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/fedora-post-install/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 28 Apr 2023 13:21:17 -0500</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/fedora-post-install/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Below is a list of post-installation tasks and tweaks I perform after installing Fedora Linux.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;system-basics&#34;&gt;System Basics&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;set-dnf-flags&#34;&gt;Set DNF Flags&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;vim /etc/dnf/dnf.conf&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;I add the following:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;max_parallel_downloads&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;m&#34;&gt;10&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;deltarpm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;True&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;defaultyes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;True&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;max_parallel_downloads=10&lt;/code&gt; allows DNF to download 10 packages at a time rather than 3 (the default).&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;deltarpm=True&lt;/code&gt; enables deltarpms&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;defaultyes=True&lt;/code&gt; makes the yes/no prompt default to yes (similar to apt and pacman)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;update-fedora&#34;&gt;Update Fedora&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;sudo dnf upgrade&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Should do this before doing anything else on your system.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Installing Fedora Asahi Remix on Apple M-series Devices</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/asahi-fedora-install/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 28 Apr 2023 09:21:40 -0500</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/asahi-fedora-install/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;before-you-begin&#34;&gt;Before you begin&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The website for Fedora Asahi Remix can be found &lt;a href=&#34;https://fedora-asahi-remix.org/&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Fedora Asahi Remix is based on Fedora Linux. More information about Fedora Linux can be found &lt;a href=&#34;https://fedoraproject.org/&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;See currently supported features &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/AsahiLinux/docs/wiki/Feature-Support&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;i-installation-script&#34;&gt;I. Installation Script&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Copy &lt;code&gt;curl https://fedora-asahi-remix.org/install | sh&lt;/code&gt; and paste into terminal.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Enter &lt;code&gt;N&lt;/code&gt; when asked to enter expert mode.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Enter &lt;code&gt;r&lt;/code&gt; to resize your current macOS partition.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Enter your desired partition sizes.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Allow the installer to complete the installation process.&#xA;&lt;em&gt;Note:&lt;/em&gt; Before you reboot, be sure to remember your username. This can be found by entering &lt;code&gt;id -un&lt;/code&gt; into a terminal.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;ii-recovery-mode&#34;&gt;II. Recovery Mode&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Enter the boot selection menu by holding down the power button until the &amp;ldquo;Loading startup options&amp;hellip;&amp;rdquo; text appears.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Select Fedora Asahi Remix in the menu using the arrow keys.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Enter your username and password as prompted.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Reboot and you should be automatically booted into Fedora Asahi Remix.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;iii-post-install-steps&#34;&gt;III. Post-install Steps&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Update your packages with &lt;code&gt;dnf upgrade&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;(Optional)&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://leitzke.me/posts/fedora-post-install&#34;&gt;Follow my personal post-installation steps for Fedora&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;</description>
    </item>
